# MVP scope gate

If the user requests work on any of the following, **do not implement**. Point to `AGENTS.md` / `docs/AUDIT.md` and suggest the MVP alternative:

- POS / Server Pad / orders / tickets / kitchen
- Revenue, average ticket, order analytics on Dashboard/Reports
- Inventory, payroll, leaderboard, loyalty points
- Marketing campaigns, SMS waitlist, reviews, AI insights
- Public marketing site / pitch deck / Upgrade to Pro upsell
- Structured menu item CRUD (v1 is PDF/image assets only)
- Guest card deposits / guest payment collection
- Staff PIN login / `pin-{pin}` auth
- Real Stripe Checkout/webhooks while `billing_provider=fake` (unless explicitly starting Stripe cutover)

Allowed pivots:

- Calendar views → merge into Bookings
- Floor plan editor → Settings → Tables
- Waitlist SMS → walk-in reservations only (no SMS)
- Fake payment wall → Stripe later via `billing_provider=stripe`

Schema changes must include `organization_id` (and `location_id` when location-scoped), RLS, and an isolation test update.
